      "writtenOn": "2022-11-15T16:54:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would be tempted to replace this test, and the previous one, with something directly testing our desired outcome:\n- After export/import, the config should be the same\n- After export/import, the CDIs should be the same (see sameInstanceKeepsSameCdis)\n\nAnd at that point we wouldn\u0027t need the @VisibleForTest.\n\nAlso, we aren\u0027t currently testing that vmImport.run() works, and that\u0027s definitely important.\n\nAs a follow-up CL we should do the same test but with 2 different apps, transferring the VM between them via binder or intent or whatever. That\u0027s significantly more complicated.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 622,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 623,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "0e31dca89e870e228600dfb90e2f2de61c630bfb",
