        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-16T09:49:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "SGTM. I tried to check the CDIs, but got an error like `android.os.ServiceSpecificException: Failed to measure attestation cdi (code 0)` in tests. Since CDI is not the focus of this change, I think we can refine it in a subsequent cl.\n\nOtherwise, I agree that we can remove @VisibleForTesting and the other test. So we just test the observable behavior.\n\nThe test of passing the descriptor from App A to App B sounds reasonable, but it\u0027s definitely not easy. I don\u0027t see any test like this yet. I imagine it should be a host test and we also need to create two apps, the first one sends an intent and the second receives it. I\u0027m also not sure how much effort it\u0027ll take to maintain such a test later (it can be flaky with all this app coordination).",
      "parentUuid": "4d087104_794de682",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 622,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 623,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "0e31dca89e870e228600dfb90e2f2de61c630bfb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
