      "key": {
        "uuid": "81a629b6_572b3acc",
        "filename": "tests/testapk/src/java/com/android/microdroid/test/MicrodroidTests.java",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 623,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-16T12:52:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You won\u0027t be able to access CDIs unless you specify a config file, which also requires enabling the custom VM permission. (And sameInstanceKeepsSameCdis does those.) But I\u0027m ok to add that in a follow-up CL. I do think it\u0027s important we test it, because it\u0027s crucial for the actual use of the feature.\n\nGetting rid of the @VisibleForTesting is cool; it also means I don\u0027t need to make them @TestApi.\n\nI agree the 2-app test is going to be pretty tricky. I think it\u0027s worthwhile, but not urgent.",
      "parentUuid": "e50729f5_2552f21d",
      "range": {
